Join us Thursday, October 1 at 12:00pm in Hart Auditorium for a panel on
judicial clerkships. Federal judges and former clerks, including attorneys
from Gibson Dunn and Latham & Watkins, will discuss the application timeline.

No food will be provided. Open to 2Ls and 3Ls.
